# Penumbra needs no secrets: it is a local app with no accounts, server or payments.
# These are the only environment variables it reads. Leave unset for normal use.

# Where the catalog (catalog.db + previews/) lives. Default: the OS app-data folder.
# Useful for tests and for keeping a catalog on another drive.
PENUMBRA_CATALOG=

# Build only (not read by the app): keep Rust build output out of synced folders such as OneDrive.
# CARGO_TARGET_DIR=%LOCALAPPDATA%\penumbra-target
